  description: "[ Pendulum Effect ] \nYou can activate 1 of these effects;\r\n\u25CF
    Special Summon this card to your Main Monster Zone in its same column.\r\n\u25CF
    Move 1 monster in your Main Monster Zone to an adjacent (horizontal) Monster
    Zone.\r\nYou can only use this effect of \"Arktos XII - Chronochasm Vaylantz\"
    once per turn.\n\n[ Monster Effect ] \n2 Level 5 or higher \"Vaylantz\" monsters\r\nMust
    first be Special Summoned (from your face-down Extra Deck) by Tributing the above
    cards. (Quick Effect): You can switch the locations of 2 monsters in your Main
    Monster Zones or 2 monsters in your opponent's Main Monster Zones. If a card
    in the Monster Zone moves to another Monster Zone (except during the Damage Step):
    You can destroy 1 card on the field. You can only use each effect of \"Arktos
    XII - Chronochasm Vaylantz\" once per turn."
